                                 display utility here: the `hidden` attribute must keep winning. */ ?>
                        <p id="hyperion-variant-stock"
                           data-hyperion-variant-stock
                           class="rounded-full bg-warning/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-warning-strong"
